{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jumping Steve is a 2d arcade style indy game with lots to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tutorials, no cut scenes, very little reading, extremely fast loading times and lots of action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Fast arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Global leader boards. (No one has beaten the Dev yet and hes acting REAL smug about it)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Mini Games (And more planned).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Retro style with modern unique design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Many achievements with hints throughout the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Several challenges for the hardcore gamer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Simple gameplay with lots of stuff to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8.\u00a0A longer description, WOW!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control Steve and jump to stay on the crows, collect the thingys and stay alive for as long as you can to increase your score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete random tasks and less random tasks like staying alive for 2 minutes to tick the boxes in your achievement list to increase the power of your log book. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock power ups in classic mode or use the M.O.D machine for some randomised madness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its arcade style of play is  perfect for taking in turns with friends. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A score board so you know whos better.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Player 2 can drop in or drop out at almost any time for some 2 player madness or go to the 2 player only VS mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;unique&quot; indie style of its own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit Camp Aign on the search for The Main Thingy and collect more Thingys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find items like the Upgraded shirt to improve your jumping and score or other items to do other stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 25 minutes of original music to discover. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with touch screen devices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first game ever made by Steves Games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created using Construct</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(The demo version is not up to date and has many bugs)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Buzz off","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844950/9c8c32ba8bbe1d99f95efdd3ef12364ed72891c0.jpg"},{"name":"Special P","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844950/5409e4bdedc2217b98442e99bdeb1d590a833122.jpg"},{"name":"5000 Thingys","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844950/afc3f0425258ac0a753afcc8e40f5087c5f12b1f.jpg"},{"name":"50 Thingys","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844950/ae41ba5feaff2e1935ac9c482b0a9ddaa7251b91.jpg"},{"name":"They are for taxidermy i swear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844950/86904266e57ffcceacf35591b3438f5779e311ac.jpg"},{"name":"Blue Hedgehog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844950/a50eee903993c736e736bcd01b41bc9b50d1a11b.jpg"},{"name":"Nopad 4000","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844950/781c9ebd1e39d4f29fee3e75e30cda5c7f5015e5.jpg"},{"name":"They make a fine soup","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844950/0af2b5c41c86baa21f63e014529efcba4de88431.jpg"},{"name":"A big score in total","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2844950/b949ef227dc1483495cea60b39ae32634d4062d8.jpg"},{"name":"Boop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/